RickRegen = (function()
--[[
	RICK PRIME REGEN  -  client-side visual, R6 only
	Plays on every respawn (not on execute).

	Everything is local. Your real character is only hidden + frozen while it plays
	(a fake clone does the exploding), then restored exactly where you stood.

	Timeline:  windup -> BURST (slowmo) -> carnage -> veins regrow -> torso hauls up
	           -> limbs yanked back one by one -> final slam

	Corpse flow: the BURST + carnage happen the moment you DIE. The splattered corpse stays where it fell.
	When you respawn, the new body is hidden + parked on the corpse (as if you were still dead); SpawnDelay
	later the corpse starts regenerating (veins regrow -> lift -> pull -> slam) into the new body.
]]

local Players    = game:GetService("Players")
local RunService = game:GetService("RunService")
local Lighting   = game:GetService("Lighting")
